   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Beatrix**: rare: 6 archived performances [2]\n- **Dons Place**: rare: 7 archived performances [2]\n- **East Side**: rare: 6 archived performances [2]\n- **Cabriolet**: rare: 7 archived performances [2]\n- **Cause We’ve Ended As Lovers**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2024-06-18** (recommended): source not stated; 10 songs; 99 min [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2024-06-18**: taped by Mark Davidson; transferred by Mark Davidson; source: AKG CK61 ULS (DIN) > Nbob Actives > Naiant PFAS > F3 [1]. Also: Recorded with AKG CK61 ULS capsules in DIN configuration, running through Nbob Actives and a Naiant PFAS preamp into an F3 recorder at 32-bit/96kHz; Transfer path: micro SD card to WAV, edited in Adobe Audition, converted to 24/48 FLAC, with fingerprints generated in xACT 2.54 [1]",
